'''''Trantor''-class supertanker fuel depots'''<ref name="SWESOV2" /> were a type of [[supertanker fuel depot]]<ref name="Encyclopedia" /><ref name="The Recruit">{{Resistance|The Recruit}}</ref> built by the [[Galactic Empire]]<ref name="Bill interview" /> to serve as refueling stations and depots.<ref name="The Recruit" /> The depots were equipped with Class 2 [[hyperdrive]]s and thrusters, enabling them to be landed on a planet from space.<ref name="No Escape 1" /> The ''[[Colossus]]'' platform on the [[ocean]] [[planet]] [[Castilon]] was one such depot, and by late in the [[Cold War]] was one of the last remaining.<ref name="The Recruit" /> During the cold war, the [[First Order]] sought out the remaining supertanker fuel depots to put them under their control in preparation for the oncoming [[First Order-Resistance War|war]], with the ''Colossus'' eventually standing as the only one of the stations not under the First Order's control. One of the First Order's supertanker fuel depots was the ''[[Titan]]'', which was [[Infiltration of the Titan|infiltrated]] by [[Kazuda Xiono]] and [[Neeku Vozo]] so they could steal a new [[trans-binary deflector]] for the ''Colossus''.<ref name="Station to Station" />

